ings, focus on cutting-edge rendering, and upscaling solutions. Achieving 60FPS can guarantee the same performance with optimized settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A score of 10,000 is translated to 60 FPS.</p>",
